(7550558, 1209731, 141319, '<td valign="top">This is the type of thing I had in mind when I tried to think of something for this challenge - a bit obvious, especially when comparing it to the other entries.</td>', 'This is the type of thing I had in mind when I tried to think of something for this challenge - a bit obvious, especially when comparing it to the other entries.', '2018-01-01 02:11:03.000000', NULL, 1),
