(7550860, 1209817, 159132, '<td valign="top">Great work - and a lot of work no doubt. That said, seems a bit contrived and not all that clear it is plastic</td>', 'Great work - and a lot of work no doubt. That said, seems a bit contrived and not all that clear it is plastic', '2018-01-02 22:47:04.000000', NULL, 1),
