(7551546, 1209745, 61396, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by tnun:</b></div><hr/><i> this is most arresting. it is the man, of course, but he is set up by the blue orange palette, and the impeccable composition. and there he is, his pale pate nearly blasted by overexposure. or maybe just 30%. His purpose in the tableau is to hold that plastic bag. for whatever it is worth. </i></td></tr></table> <br/><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by tnun:</b></div><hr/><i> ha. my only ten, my only comment. </i></td></tr></table> <br/>thank you for seeing and thank you for caring</td>', 'Originally posted by tnun: this is most arresting. it is the man, of course, but he is set up by the blue orange palette, and the impeccable composition. and there he is, his pale pate nearly blasted by overexposure. or maybe just 30%. His purpose in the tableau is to hold that plastic bag. for whatever it is worth.  Originally posted by tnun: ha. my only ten, my only comment.  thank you for seeing and thank you for caring', '2018-01-08 00:48:12.000000', NULL, 0),
